{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14109080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14109080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410908001:1":{"text":"저 목소리는! 드래곤... 드래곤이 날아갔어!","source_cn":"那声音！是龙……龙飞走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4D7B9EDCF69B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410908002:1":{"text":"소리가 광장 쪽에서 들리네요! 잠시 가봐야할 것 같습니다...","source_cn":"声音从广场那边传来！我得去看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB2782EFB5C32C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410908003:1":{"text":"여왕님께서는 이제 안 계시니, 그 마력으로 유지되고 있던 석상도 부서질 겁니다. 그렇다면 셀로클랜드는 혼란에 빠지겠지요.","source_cn":"女王一旦崩逝，她用魔力维系的女王雕像也会随之破碎，萨洛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D43F98E1339C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410908004:1":{"text":"인듀어! 뭘 하려는 건지는 알겠지만, 넌 방금... 지금 가는 건 위험해!","source_cn":"因度厄！你的意思我懂，但你刚刚杀了……这时候过去也太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA13876BCEE1C82D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410908005:1":{"text":"그래서 가야 합니다.","source_cn":"正因如此，我更要去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89FBB20B63FF686","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410908006:1":{"text":"근위대는 질서를 지키고 백성들을 안정시켜야 합니다. 설령...","source_cn":"卫队需要维持秩序，安抚民众。哪怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F65CC6C98CAAB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410908007:1":{"text":"이 멍청이가! 지금 가서 붙잡히면 어쩔건데?","source_cn":"你这个死脑筋！现在过去要是被抓了可怎么办！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FABB1C46D712648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410908008:1":{"text":"저는 셀로클랜드의 근위대장, 인듀어입니다. 제 직책이 박탈당하지 않은 이상...","source_cn":"我是因度厄，萨洛克兰的卫队长。在我的职务尚未被解除之前——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F0D738797E48CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410908009:1":{"text":"백성들이 저를 가장 필요로 할 때 숨어있지 않겠습니다!","source_cn":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6DC7983119280B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1410908009":{"text":"백성들이 저를 가장 필요로 할 때 숨어있지 않겠습니다!","source_cn":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6DC7983119280B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:14109080